\"v-m\">榻榻米；日式草席地板</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103952\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>畳<rp>(</rp><rt>たたみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>だい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>字<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他完全躺在垫子上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">畳む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たたむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">折叠（衣服、雨伞等）；关闭；歇业（店铺、生意）；腾空；搬离</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91708\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はハンカチをきちんと<ruby>畳<rp>(</rp><rt>たた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她把手帕整齐地折了起来</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ただ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">普通；常见；平常；免费；无偿；未受影响；原样；安全；只；仅；仅仅；只是；但是；然而；可是</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"177669\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はただ<ruby>皿<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>洗<rp>(</rp><rt>あら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いさえすればいい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你要做的就是洗盘子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">但し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ただし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"j