an class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">停止；停下；站住；暂停</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78118\"><ruby>旅人<rp>(</rp><rt>たびびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まって<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">旅行者停下来问我路</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">立場</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たちば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">立场；地位；处境；观点；立场；视角</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">たちまち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">瞬间；转眼；立刻；旋即；突然；陡然；猝不及防</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142096\"><ruby>切符<rp>(</rp><rt>きっぷ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたちまち<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">门票马上就卖完了</span></div></li>"]